{# Two footers stacked, because they answer to two different owners.

   The first is the report's own closing band — the download call to action the
   Figma design ends on. The second is the institutional footer from the UNDP
   Design System 2.0.2 (undp/design-system, Footer organism, "simple" variant),
   which the client asked for and which has to look the same here as on every
   other UNDP property.

   The design system's *default* variant also carries four navigation columns and
   a newsletter form. Both are left out: in the design system itself their content
   is the placeholder "Page title", and this site has no newsletter endpoint —
   inventing either would put dead links in a UN footer.

   The four rows are siblings rather than the design system's nested
   footer-top/footer-bottom wrappers, because the social row changes place
   between breakpoints (beside the logo on desktop, above the copyright on
   mobile) and one grid can move it without duplicating the markup. #}

{#- The download band carries the same gradient and the same indent as a chapter
    opening: kicker on the column edge, the line that follows set in at 415px.
    The design gives the download no button box — the sentence is the link. #}
<section class="report-cta" aria-labelledby="report-cta-title">
  <div class="report-cta__inner">
    <p class="report-cta__kicker" id="report-cta-title">{{ c.footer.kicker | t(en.footer.kicker) }}</p>
    {%- if assets.reportPdf %}
    <a class="report-cta__link" href="{{ (c.footer.file | t(en.footer.file)) | url }}" download>
      {{ c.footer.cta | t(en.footer.cta) }}
    </a>
    {%- else %}
    <span class="report-cta__link report-cta__link--pending" title="{{ c.header.downloadPending | t(en.header.downloadPending) }}">
      {{ c.footer.cta | t(en.footer.cta) }}
    </span>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{%- set uf = c.undpFooter %}
{%- set enUf = en.undpFooter %}
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <a href="{{ site.undpFooter.logoLink }}">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/img/undp/undp-logo-white.svg' | url }}"
             alt="{{ uf.logoAlt | t(enUf.logoAlt) }}" width="106" height="218">
      </a>
      <p class="footer-logo__name">
        <span>{{ uf.brandLine1 | t(enUf.brandLine1) }}</span>
        <span>{{ uf.brandLine2 | t(enUf.brandLine2) }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="footer-icons" role="list" aria-label="{{ uf.socialLabel | t(enUf.socialLabel) }}">
      {%- for s in site.undpFooter.social %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ s.url }}" title="{{ s.title }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
          <img src="{{ ('/assets/img/undp/' + s.name + '-white.svg') | url }}" alt="{{ s.title }}" width="20" height="20">
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <ul class="footer-lists" role="list">
      {%- for l in enUf.links %}
      <li><a href="{{ site.undpFooter.links[loop.index0] }}">{{ uf.links[loop.index0].label | t(l.label) }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <p class="footer-copyright">{{ uf.copyright | t(enUf.copyright) }}</p>
  </div>
</footer>
